{
  "uid": "bs-logistics-gateway",
  "title": "АС: шлюз перевозчика C03",
  "tags": [
    "blood-supply",
    "logistics",
    "c03"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "ds",
        "label": "Источник метрик",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0,
        "refresh": 1,
        "options": []
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "blood-supply"
      ],
      "asDropdown": true,
      "title": "Дашборды АС"
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Шлюз `logistics-gateway`: заказы перевозки в C03, исходы UNKNOWN (C03 долго недоступна, «не знаем») и FAILED (после UNKNOWN сверка заказа не нашла). Runbook: `docs/runbooks/gateway-unknown-failed.md`."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Заказы",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Заказы по статусам (метрика появится в этапе 8)",
      "description": "Планируемая метрика: датчик `logistics.transport.orders{status}`.\n\nМетрика ещё не экспортируется. План: датчики заказов шлюза по статусам и счётчик попыток C03 в logistics-gateway, отдельный пакет этапа 8.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (status) (logistics_transport_orders)",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "Метрика появится в этапе 8",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Заказы в UNKNOWN и FAILED (метрика появится в этапе 8)",
      "description": "Метрика ещё не экспортируется. План: датчики заказов шлюза по статусам и счётчик попыток C03 в logistics-gateway, отдельный пакет этапа 8.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(logistics_transport_orders{status=\"UNKNOWN\"})",
          "legendFormat": "UNKNOWN",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum(logistics_transport_orders{status=\"FAILED\"})",
          "legendFormat": "FAILED",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "Метрика появится в этапе 8",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Попытки отправки в C03 (метрика появится в этапе 8)",
      "description": "Планируемая метрика: `logistics.c03.attempts{outcome}` — каждая попытка, включая повторы.\n\nМетрика ещё не экспортируется. План: датчики заказов шлюза по статусам и счётчик попыток C03 в logistics-gateway, отдельный пакет этапа 8.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (outcome) (rate(logistics_c03_attempts_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{outcome}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "noValue": "Метрика появится в этапе 8",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Вызовы C03 (итог после повторов)",
      "description": "`httpx.client.calls` с client=c03 (libs/httpx, ветка этапа 1 logistics-gateway).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 12
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (outcome) (rate(httpx_client_calls_total{job=\"logistics-gateway\",client=\"c03\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{outcome}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "HTTP шлюза",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 20
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Запросы в секунду",
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 21
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (job) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{job=\"logistics-gateway\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Доля ошибок 5xx",
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 21
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (job) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{job=\"logistics-gateway\",http_response_status_code=~\"5..\"}[$__rate_interval])) / sum by (job) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{job=\"logistics-gateway\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Длительность, p95",
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 21
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (job, le) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"logistics-gateway\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
